        {
          "type": "learn",
          "id": "co7-coverage-02",
          "title": "Fake man, fake zone",
          "body": "Pressed corners scream man, but they can bail to deep zones at the snap. Off corners with eyes on the quarterback look like zone, but they can lock onto receivers.",
          "concept": "disguise"
        },
        {
          "type": "learn",
          "id": "co7-coverage-03",
          "title": "Brackets",
          "body": "Two defenders on one star receiver, one under and one over, often from a shell that looks normal. The rest of the coverage has to stretch to cover the gap.",
          "concept": "bracket"
        },
